0/01/1955939/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(今回の個別の服です〜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天のコメントや個人ＰＶの予告を観てくれた感想くれてありがとう！\n滝にうたれましたよ〜！笑\n身が引き締まったっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVのあのウエイターさんが誰だかわかった？笑\nそして\nスタッフさんも皆んな優しくて本当に楽しく撮ってもらえましたぁ ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、広島出身の二人組！ひめたんと月刊エンタメさんに出させていただきました〜是非チェックしてねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/01/wada44.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/01/wada55.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/01/wada66.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/01/wada77.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/01/1955939/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/01/1955939/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/01/1955939/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2014/10/01/1955939/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シーユーネクストタイム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}